 result←object ShowNode arg;tree;opr;node;ndx;previous
 ⍝ [1]←'select', 'drop', or 'firstvisible'
 ⍝ [2]←Node ID, or 0, or 'none'

 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: ShowNode'##.##.Error 2≠≢arg←##.##.Single arg
 (opr node)←arg
 '∆WI ACTION ERROR: Invalid operation for "ShowNode" method'##.##.Error~opr⊂⍛∊'select' 'drop' 'firstvisible'
 '''drop'' operation not yet implemented'##.##.Error opr≡'drop'
 tree←object ⎕VGET⊂'_list'(0 5⍴0)

 :Select opr
 :Case 'select'
     :If node≡'none' ⋄ node←0 ⋄ :EndIf
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: ShowNode'##.##.Error 1≠≢node
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: ShowNode'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt node
     ('∆WI ARGUMENT ERROR: Item ',(⍕⊃node~tree[;1]),' not found ("ShowNode" method)')##.##.Error(node≠0)∧~∧/node∊tree[;1]
     ndx←tree[;1]⍳node←⊃node
     previous←⊃tree[;1]/⍨object ##.##.∆WG'SelItems'
     :If result←{⍵≡0 0⍴'':1 ⋄ ⍵}'Validate'##.##.Event object ##.##.Application,¯2,previous,node
         object ##.##.∆WS'SelItems'(ndx∊⍨⍳≢tree) ⍝ Turn off everything but that one node
     :EndIf
 :Case 'drop'
     ⍝? Not yet implemented
 :Case 'firstvisible'
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: ShowNode'##.##.Error 1≠≢node
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: ShowNode'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt node
     ('∆WI ARGUMENT ERROR: Item ',(⍕⊃node~tree[;1]),' not found ("ShowNode" method)')##.##.Error(node≠0)∧~∧/node∊tree[;1]
     ndx←tree[;1]⍳node←⊃node
     object ##.##.∆WS'Index'ndx ⍝ Scroll it to the top (if the list is long enough to scroll there)
⍝? Will this operation make the node visible as well (in both systems)?
     result←1
 :EndSelect
